This licence covers the code in this repository. Everything it depends on is
fetched at runtime rather than redistributed here, and each carries its own
terms:

  VisA dataset      CC BY 4.0. Downloaded by scripts/get_visa.py from the
                    Hugging Face mirror BrachioLab/visa.
                    https://github.com/amazon-science/spot-diff

  DINOv2 weights    Apache 2.0, by Meta. Downloaded by timm when the model is
                    constructed. https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2

  anomalib          Apache 2.0. https://github.com/open-edge-platform/anomalib

  Dinomaly          The method, Guo et al., CVPR 2025. This repository uses
                    anomalib's implementation, not the authors' own code.
                    arXiv:2405.14325

The trained checkpoint published as a release asset of this repository is
covered by this licence. It contains only the bottleneck and decoder weights
fitted here; the frozen DINOv2 encoder is not included in it.
